    sources: ["UNESCO General History of Africa", "Archives of the 1958 French Community referendum", "International Crisis Group reporting on Guinea's political transitions", "Djibril Tamsir Niane, 'The Origins of Samori's State' (Mande Studies, 2001)", "The Cambridge History of Africa, Vol. 6 (1870–1905), on Samori Touré and Fouta Djallon"]
