    sources: ["UNESCO General History of Africa", "Amílcar Cabral Foundation archives", "UNODC reporting on West African trafficking routes", "Carlos Lopes, 'Kaabunké: An Historical Reconstruction of the Kingdom of Kaabu' (1987)", "Djibril Tamsir Niane, 'Histoire des Mandingues de l'Ouest' (1989)"]
